{
  "title": "05 — Service Health: platform-gateway",
  "uid": "platform-gateway-service-health",
  "tags": [
    "tripbot",
    "platform-gateway",
    "service-health"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
        },
        "query": "label_values(kube_pod_info, cluster)",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "deployment_environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
        },
        "query": "label_values(platform_gateway_up, namespace)",
        "current": {
          "text": "prod-1",
          "value": "prod-1"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "platform",
        "label": "Platform",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "twitch,youtube,facebook,instagram,tiktok",
        "current": {
          "text": "twitch",
          "value": "twitch"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 99,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`gateway-$platform` is the per-platform API gateway (the `platform_gateway_*` metrics from `internal/metrics`, [platform-gateway#14](https://github.com/adanalife/platform-gateway/pull/14)). Unlike tripbot's OTel-push metrics, these are **annotation-scraped** (`prometheus.io/scrape` on the pod), so they carry `cluster`/`namespace`/`pod` — filtered here by `namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\"` and `pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"`. The environment variable is named `deployment_environment` (though it reads the `namespace` label) so a `?var-deployment_environment=` link presets it exactly as it does on the OTLP-fed service-health dashboards. Only **prod-1** ships to Grafana Cloud (stage-1 is dropped at the Alloy layer), so only prod `gateway-twitch` populates these panels. **The Twitch Helix row is the only place Twitch Helix metrics live** — the gateway is the single Helix caller, and the tripbot-side `twitch_helix_*` panels that used to sit on the Twitch Chat Activity dashboard are gone. Helix-row panels are twitch-only (`pod=~\"gateway-twitch.*\"`); a youtube gateway leaves them empty."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Façade",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Up (last 1m)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(time() - max(timestamp(last_over_time(platform_gateway_up{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}[5m])))) < bool 60"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "STALE",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / sec",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(platform_gateway_requests_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Upstream failures (502) / sec",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(platform_gateway_requests_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\", status=\"502\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Not-supported (501) / sec",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(platform_gateway_requests_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\", status=\"501\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests / sec by op",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (op) (rate(platform_gateway_requests_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{op}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests / sec by status",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(platform_gateway_requests_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request latency by op (p50 / p95)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (op, le) (rate(platform_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{op}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (op, le) (rate(platform_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{op}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Twitch Helix",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Helix rate remaining",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(platform_gateway_helix_ratelimit_remaining{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-twitch.*\"})"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Upstream errors (5m)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(platform_gateway_upstream_errors_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-twitch.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Helix rate budget over time",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(platform_gateway_helix_ratelimit_remaining{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-twitch.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "remaining"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max(platform_gateway_helix_ratelimit_limit{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-twitch.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Upstream errors by provider, endpoint and status (per min)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (provider, endpoint, status) (rate(platform_gateway_upstream_errors_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-twitch.*\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} {{endpoint}} ({{status}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 700,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent traces (platform-gateway)",
      "description": "Most recent traces for the gateway. Only prod-1 ships traces to Grafana Cloud, so rows appear once the prod gateway is live.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "__DS_TEMPO__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 50,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"platform-gateway\" && resource.deployment.environment =~ \"$deployment_environment\" } | select(resource.deployment.environment)",
          "limit": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Running version",
      "description": "Running gateway build version from platform_gateway_build_info (ldflags-stamped). One row per live version; two rows means a rollout in flight or version skew across platform instances.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "platform_gateway_build_info{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{version}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "description": "Wall-clock age of the most-recently-started gateway pod (time() - max pod start), from kube-state-metrics. Resets on every deploy/restart; a value that keeps resetting means the pod is cycling. Scoped to the selected cluster + platform.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - max(kube_pod_start_time{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"})"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "no pods"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pod restarts",
      "description": "Total container restarts across the gateway pods in the selected cluster/platform (kube-state-metrics). Green at 0; any restart turns it red — a crash-loop or OOMKill signal the request metrics can not show.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\", pod=~\"gateway-$platform.*\"})"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Fleet & config (all platforms — not $platform-scoped)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Platform enabled",
      "description": "1 when that gateway reports its platform as enabled, 0 when it is switched off. One tile row per running gateway container. This metric carries no platform label — the platform is the container name — so this panel is deliberately not $platform-scoped: it is the fleet view, and a platform switched off is exactly what you want to see next to the ones that are on.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (container) (platform_gateway_platform_enabled{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no data",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DISABLED",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "enabled",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat connected",
      "description": "1 when the gateway holds a live chat connection for its platform, 0 when it does not. Pair with tripbot's own 'Twitch Chat Connected' tile on dashboard 03: this one 0 while that one 1 localises the fault to the gateway rather than the path between them. Not $platform-scoped, for the same reason as the tile beside it — the metric carries no platform label.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (container) (platform_gateway_chat_connected{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "no data",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DISCONNECTED",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "connected",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Stream metadata drift by field",
      "description": "1 when the platform's live stream metadata no longer matches what the gateway intends for it, per field (title, category, tags, description). Drift means somebody or something changed the stream's title or category out from under us — the gateway notices but does not force it back, so this is the only signal. Flat 0 across every field is the healthy reading.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__DS_PROMETHEUS__"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (platform, field) (platform_gateway_metadata_drift{cluster=~\"$cluster\", namespace=~\"$deployment_environment\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{platform}} · {{field}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
